  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) - University of Reading</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) provided organisations with resources to sustain UKRI grant-funded research during the period of pandemic disruption and its immediate aftermath. Some of the funding was directly used supporting the following ODA-eligible grants at University of Reading: NE/S005889/1; 
AH/S011633/1; 
BB/S018964/1; 
MR/S036423/1; 
BB/T012323/1; 
EP/T020040/1.</narrative>
  </description>
